    "description": {
      "content": "The ShortKit API lets you manage content, uploads, live streams, surveys, analytics, and ad configuration for your short-form vertical video feeds. It is organized around REST, uses standard HTTP methods, returns JSON wrapped in a standard envelope, and uses conventional HTTP status codes. All requests must be made over HTTPS.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: ShortKit",
